Z||000000||LoW_KeY||11-15-2001||05:54 PM||||I'm curious any way to get these off with out leaving residue.. when I got my paint job last year the put the 'Formula' towards the front of the door like the firebirds GRR.. and I wanted to replace it so my car looks normal.<P>Yes little things like this bother me but hey what can I say  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||Raydar||11-15-2001||05:59 PM||||Easiest way is to use a heat gun or hair dryer. Heat the letters till they get warm and flexible and peel them off. Just be sure you don't get the paint too hot, or you can gouge it or probably even scorch it.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
